Pigmee Tech
===========

This is an unofficial Minecraft 1.12.2 / Cleanroom port of the pigmee
subsystem of AE2 Lightning Tech. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the
AE2 Lightning Tech authors, the Applied Energistics: Crystal Science authors,
or the Applied Energistics 2 team.

