Port
----

Minecraft 1.12.2 port, Cleanroom adaptation, and subsequent modifications:
- Copyright (c) 2026 KleinBlue

The port rewrites the 1.21.1 NeoForge implementation against 1.12.2 Forge APIs:
block/state/metadata registration, tile entities and TESRs, the 1.12.2 model
and CTM pipeline, Forge's ore dictionary, NBTTagCompound item data, legacy GUI
and networking, and 1.12.2 recipe registration. The project scaffolding follows
the conventions of AE2 Crystal Science: Legacy
(https://github.com/Kt-wang/AE2-Crystal-Science-Legacy).

